{"title": "Pest Control", "pageid": 34338, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Pest_Control", "categories": ["Achievements"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Pest Control</b> an <a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\">achievement</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. It requires the player to kill the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/25px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/38px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/50px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/25px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\">Phase Spider Matriarch</a> before her eggs hatch.\n</p><p>The matriarch and a number of other phase spiders are found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Depths\" title=\"Whispering Depths\">Whispering Depths</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>, which can be accessed from the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a>, either by going down the well in the village's center, or by breaking a wall in the cellar of the blacksmith's workshop.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Strategy\">Strategy</span></h2>\n<p>To get the achievement, the player must kill the spider before she can hatch any of the three clusters of eggs located atop three stone platforms around her nesting spot. This is made challenging by the fact that her first action upon entering combat is often to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ethereal_Jaunt\" title=\"Ethereal Jaunt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/25px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/38px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/50px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Jaunt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/25px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ethereal_Jaunt\" title=\"Ethereal Jaunt\">Ethereal Jaunt</a> to teleport near one of the egg clusters and hatch it.\n</p><p>The easiest approach is to have a party member with good <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">stealth</a> capabilities sneak onto the two platforms that are furthest from the matriarch, and destroy those clusters first. This is possible without it being noticed at all. Attacking the last egg cluster, which is closer to adult spiders in the area, is likely to be noticed and thus initiate combat, but this is not a problem since the cluster is easily destroyed in one attack.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201837\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 478/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3608/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 750/4194304 bytes\nHighes